ite background.\n[Shot 1] A medium shot frames <Subject 1>, the fire koi, positioned diagonally across the frame with its head toward the lower right and its curving body sweeping upward toward the upper left. The koi swims forward in a single smooth undulating wave along its body axis, its muscular torso flexing gently from the tail toward the head. The flame-like translucent dorsal, pectoral, pelvic, and caudal fins trail behind in soft flowing motion, their orange-yellow fire edges flickering subtly as they move. The glossy golden-red scales catch light with a warm metallic sheen. The two slender red barbels sway gently with the water current. Tiny golden sparks drift slowly around the body. The camera remains static with a gentle slow push-in, keeping the entire koi centered in frame. The lighting is soft and diffused, emanating from the koi's own glowing scales and flame fins, casting a warm amber reflection on the pale background below.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nSoft underwater ambient hum and a faint warm crackling fire-like fizzing sound accompany the koi's movement, blending water ripples with the subtle crackle of ember.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 36, "type": "Text Multiline", "properties": {"cnr_id": "was-node-suite-comfyui", "ver": "fe7e0884aaf0188248d9abf1e500f5116097fec1", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 12, "widgets_values_named": {"text": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the fire koi in <Picture 1>, with a glossy golden-red scaled body, a bright crimson head, large round golden-amber eyes, two slender red barbels extending from the mouth, and flame-like translucent fins and tail trailing behind in glowing orange-yellow firelight. Small golden sparks drift around its body.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video shows <Subject 1> swimming forward in a smooth undulating motion, its flame-like fins and tail rippling gently behind it. The visual appearance, color palette, and fiery texture of the koi are derived from <Picture 1>.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the golden-red scaled body, crimson head, golden-amber eyes, red barbels, flame-like fins and tail, and drifting golden sparks are all preserved from <Picture 1>.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is a 3D Eastern fantasy animated style with PBR physical rendering, 8K ultra-high definition, and a clean soft-white background.\n[Shot 1] A medium shot frames <Subject 1>, the fire koi, positioned diagonally across the frame with its head toward the lower right and its curving body sweeping upward toward the upper left. The koi swims forward in a single smooth undulating wave along its body axis, its muscular torso flexing gently from the tail toward the head. The flame-like translucent dorsal, pectoral, pelvic, and caudal fins trail behind in soft flowing motion, their orange-yellow fire edges flickering subtly as they move. The glossy golden-red scales catch light with a warm metallic sheen. The two slender red barbels sway gently with the water current. Tiny golden sparks drift slowly around the body. The camera remains static with a gentle slow push-in, keeping the entire koi centered in frame. The lighting is soft and diffused, emanating from the koi's own glowing scales and flame fins, casting a warm amber reflection on the pale background below.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nSoft underwater ambient hum and a faint warm crackling fire-like fizzing sound accompany the koi's movement, blending water ripples with the subtle crackle of ember.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A\n"}}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "front